acetone (1 in 50) on the plate, and heat the plate at 809C for 5 minutes: the spots other than the principal spot obtained from the sample solu-tion are not more intense than the spot from the standard so-lution. Loss on drying <2.41> Not more than 0.30z (1 g, 1059C, 3 hours). Residue on ignition <2.44> Not more than 0.1z (1 g)."
          }
        },
