      "definition": {
        "en": "Amoxapine, when dried, contains not less than ard solution, add the mobile phase to make 50 mL, and use this solution as the standard solution."
      },
      "appearance": {
        "en": "Amoxapine occurs as white to light yellow- white, crystals or crystalline powder. It is freely soluble in acetic acid (100), slightly soluble in ethanol (95) and in diethyl ether, and practically insoluble in water."
      },
      "testSpecification": [
