        "en": "Ampiroxicam occurs as a white to yellowish white crystalline powder. It is freely soluble in acetic acid (100), soluble in aceto-nitrile, very slightly soluble in ethanol (99.5), and practically insoluble in water. A solution of Ampiroxicam in acetonitrile (1 in 20) shows no optical rotation. It shows crystal polymorphism."
