        "en": "Bepotastine Besilate occurs as white to pale yellow-white, crystals or crystalline powder. It is very soluble in acetic acid (100), and sparingly soluble in water and in ethanol (99.5). The pH of a solution of 1 g of Bepotastine Besilate in 100 mL of water is about 3.8."
