        "en": "Berberine Chloride Hydrate occurs as yellow, crystals or crystalline powder. It is odorless or has a faint, characteristic odor. It has a very bitter taste. It is sparingly soluble in methanol, slightly soluble in ethanol (95), and very slightly soluble in water."
      },
