        "en": "Betahistine Mesilate occurs as white, crystals or crystalline powder. It is very soluble in water, freely soluble in acetic acid (100), and sparingly soluble in ethanol (99.5). It dissolves in dilute hydrochloric acid. It is hygroscopic."
