en the procedure is run with 40 mL of this solution under the above operating conditions, orcin and cefroxadine are eluted in this order with the resolution between these peaks being not less than 3. System repeatability: When the test is repeated 6 times with 40 mL of the standard solution under the above operat-ing conditions, the relative standard deviation of the peak area of cefroxadine is not more than 2.0z. Water <2.48> Not less than 8.5z and not more than 12.0z (0.1 g, volumetric titration, direct titration)."
