, ciclacillin and the internal standard are eluted in this order with the resolution between these peaks being not less than 8. System repeatability: When the test is repeated 6 times with 10 mL of the standard solution under the above operat-ing conditions, the relative standard deviation of the ratios of the peak areas of ciclacillin to that of the internal stand-ard is not more than 1.0z."
