            "en": "Weigh accurately about 0.5 g of Clonazepam, previ-ously dried, dissolve in 70 mL of acetic anhydride, and titrate <2.50> with 0.1 mol/L perchloric acid VS (potentio-metric titration). Perform a blank determination in the same manner, and make any necessary correction. Each mL of 0.1 mol/L perchloric acid VS ＝ 31.57 mg of C15H10ClN3O3"
          }
        }
      ],
      "storageConditions": {
        "en": "Containers—Well-closed contain-ers."
      }
