        "en": "Donepezil Hydrochloride occurs as a white crystalline powder. It is soluble in water, and slightly soluble in ethanol (99.5). A solution of Donepezil Hydrochloride (1 in 100) shows no optical rotation. Donepezil Hydrochloride shows crystal polymorphism."
