            "en": "Weigh accurately about 0.5 g of Ebastine, previ-ously dried, dissolve in 60 mL of acetic acid (100), and titrate <2.50> with 0.1 mol/L perchloric acid VS (potentiometric titration). Perform a blank determination in the same man-ner, and make any necessary correction. Each mL of 0.1 mol/L perchloric acid VS ＝ 46.97 mg of C32H39NO2"
          }
        }
      ],
      "storageConditions": {
        "en": "Containers—Well-closed contain-ers."
      }
