        "en": "Eperisone Hydrochloride contains not less than 98."
      },
      "appearance": {
        "en": "Eperisone Hydrochloride occurs as a white crystalline powder. It is freely soluble in water, in methanol and in acetic acid (100), and soluble in ethanol (99.5). Melting point: about 1679C (with decomposition). A solution of Eperisone Hydrochloride in methanol (1 in 100) shows no optical rotation."
      },
      "testSpecification": [
        {
