      "molecularFormula": "C9H13NO3",
      "molecularWeight": 183.2,
      "appearance": {
        "en": "Adrenaline occurs as a white to grayish white crystalline powder. It is freely soluble in formic acid and in acetic acid (100), very slightly soluble in water, and practically insoluble in methanol and in ethanol (99.5). It dissolves in dilute hydrochloric acid. It gradually changes to brown in color by air and by light."
      },
