        "en": "Hydroxyzine Pamoate occurs as a light yellow crystalline powder. It is odorless, and has a slightly bitter taste. It is freely soluble in N,N-dimethylformamide, slightly soluble in acetone, and practically insoluble in water, in methanol, in ethanol (95) and in diethyl ether."
