            "en": "Determine the infrared absorption spectrum of Hypromellose Acetate Succinate as directed in the ATR method under Infrared Spectrophotometry <2.25>: it exhibits absorption at the wave numbers of about 2840 cm－1, 1737 cm－1, 1371 cm－1, 1231 cm－1 and 1049 cm－1. Viscosity <2.53> To 2.00 g of Hypromellose Acetate Suc-cinate, previously dried, add dilute sodium hydroxide TS to make 100.0 g, stopper tightly, and dissolve by shaking for 30 minutes. Perform the test with this solution at 209C accord-ing to Method 1: 80 – 120z of the labeled viscosity."
