      "appearance": {
        "en": "Iodine occurs as grayish black, plates or granular, heavy crystals, having a metallic luster and a char-acteristic odor. It is freely soluble in diethyl ether, soluble in ethanol (95), sparingly soluble in chloroform, and very slightly soluble in water. It dissolves in potassium iodide TS. It sublimes at room temperature."
