      "appearance": {
        "en": "Itraconazole occurs as a white powder. It is soluble in N,N-dimethylformamide, very slightly soluble in ethanol (99.5), and practically insoluble in water and in 2-propanol. A solution of Itraconazole in N,N-dimethylformamide (1 in 100) shows no optical rotation."
