            "en": "Weigh accurately about 0.4 g of Kainic Acid Hy-drate, previously dried, and dissolve in 50 mL of warm water, cool and titrate <2.50> with 0.1 mol/L sodium hy-droxide VS (indicator: 10 drops of bromothymol blue TS). Each mL of 0.1 mol/L sodium hydroxide VS ＝ 21.32 mg of C10H15NO4"
          }
        }
