        "en": "Lenograstim (Genetical Recombination) is an aque-ous solution in which a desired product is a recom-binant human granulocyte colony-stimulating factor produced in Chinese hamster ovary cells. It is a glycoprotein (molecular mass: ca. 20,000) consisting of 174 amino acid residues. It contains not less than 0."
      },
