            "en": "(1) Related substances—Perform the test with a volume of Lenograstim (Genetical Recombination), equiva-lent to 30 mg of protein, as directed under Liquid Chroma- number of theoretical plates of the peak of lenograstim is not less than 2700. Host cell proteins—Being specified separately when the drug is granted approval based on the Law. Host cell DNA—Being specified separately when the drug is granted approval based on the Law."
