      "molecularFormula": "C17H25N3O5S.3H2O",
      "molecularWeight": 437.51,
      "definition": {
        "en": "Meropenem Hydrate contains not less than 980 mg (potency) and not more than 1010 mg (potency) per mg, calculated on the anhydrous basis."
      },
      "appearance": {
        "en": "Meropenem Hydrate occurs as a white to light yellow crystalline powder. It is sparingly soluble in water, and practically insoluble in ethanol (95) and in diethyl ether. It dissolves in sodium hydrogen carbonate TS."
