      "appearance": {
        "en": "Methyl Salicylate is a colorless to pale yellow liquid. It has a strong, characteristic odor. It is miscible with ethanol (95) and with diethyl ether. It is very slightly soluble in water. Specific gravity d 20: 1.182 – 1.192 Boiling point: 219 – 2249C"
