      "status": "Official",
      "version": "18",
      "appearance": {
        "en": "Miconazole Nitrate occurs as a white crystal-line powder. It is freely soluble in N,N-dimethylformamide, sparingly soluble in methanol, slightly soluble in ethanol (95), in ace-tone and in acetic acid (100), and very slightly soluble in water and in diethyl ether. Melting point: about 1809C (with decomposition)."
