      "molecularFormula": "C8H9NO2",
      "molecularWeight": 151.16,
      "appearance": {
        "en": "Acetaminophen occurs as white, crystals or crystalline powder. It is freely soluble in methanol and in ethanol (95), spar-ingly soluble in water, and very slightly, soluble in diethyl ether. It dissolves in sodium hydroxide TS."
      },
      "testSpecification": [
        {
