      "molecularWeight": 1571.67,
      "casNumber": "70384-29-1",
      "definition": {
        "en": "Peplomycin Sulfate is the sulfate of a substance having antitumor activity produced by the growth of Streptomyces verticillus. It contains not less than 865 mg (potency) and not more than 1010 mg (potency) per mg, calculated on the dried basis."
