          "testName": {
            "en": "Assay"
          },
          "testType": "TestType-Assay",
          "testConditions": {
            "en": "Weigh accurately about 0.3 g of Pilsicainide Hydro-chloride Hydrate, dissolve it in 10 mL of acetic acid (100), ‌add 40 mL of acetic anhydride, and titrate <2.50> with 0.1 mol/L perchloric acid VS (potentiometric titration). Per-form a blank determination in the same manner, and make any necessary correction. Each mL of 0.1 mol/L perchloric acid VS ＝ 31.79 mg of C17H24N2O.HCl.1/2 H2O"
