      "version": "18",
      "appearance": {
        "en": "Povidone occurs as a white to slightly yellow-ish fine powder. It is odorless or has a faint, characteristic odor. It is freely soluble in water, in methanol and in ethanol (99.5). It is hygroscopic.◆"
