          "testConditions": {
            "en": "To a volume of Thiamine Chloride Hydro- ‌chloride Injection, equivalent to 0.05 g of Thiamine Chloride Hydrochloride, add water to make 25 mL. Proceed with 5 mL of this solution as directed in the Identification (1) under Thiamine Chloride Hydrochloride.‌ Bacterial endotoxins <4.01> Less than 6.0 EU/mg. Extractable volume <6.05> It meets the requirement. Foreign insoluble matter <6.06> Perform the test according to Method 1: it meets the requirement. Insoluble particulate matter <6.07> It meets the require-ment. Sterility <4.06> Perform the test according to the Mem-brane filtration method: it meets the requirement."
