        "en": "Ribavirin occurs as a white crystalline powder. It is freely soluble in water and in N, N-dimethylfor-mamide, slightly soluble in methanol, and practically insolu- ble in ethanol (99.5). Melting point: 167 – 1719C Ribavirin shows crystal polymorphism."
