          "testType": "TestType-Assay",
          "testConditions": {
            "en": "Weigh accurately about 0.16 g of Risperidone, dis-solve in 70 mL of a mixture of 2-butanone and acetic acid (100) (7:1), and titrate <2.50> with 0.1 mol/L perchloric acid VS (potentiometric titration). Perform a blank determina-tion in the same manner, and make any necessary correction. Each mL of 0.1 mol/L perchloric acid VS ＝ 20.52 mg of C23H27FN4O2"
          }
        }
      ],
      "storageConditions": {
        "en": "Containers—Tight containers."
      }
