      "appearance": {
        "en": "Ritodrine Hydrochloride occurs as a white crystalline powder. It is freely soluble in water, in methanol and in ethanol (99.5). It dissolves in 0.01 mol/L hydrochloric acid TS. A solution of Ritodrine Hydrochloride (1 in 10) shows no optical rotation. It is gradually colored to light yellow by light. Melting point: about 1969C (with decomposition)."
