        "en": "Suxamethonium Chloride Hydrate occurs as a white crystalline powder. It is freely soluble in water, in methanol and in acetic acid (100), slightly soluble in ethanol (95), very slightly soluble in acetic anhydride, and practically insoluble in diethyl ether."
      },
      "testSpecification": [
        {
