      "appearance": {
        "en": "Ubenimex occurs as a white crystalline pow-der. It is freely soluble in acetic acid (100), slightly soluble in water, and very slightly soluble in ethanol (99.5). It dissolves in 1 mol/L hydrochloric acid TS. Melting point: about 2309C (with decomposition)."
