            "en": "(1) Heavy metals <1.07>—Proceed with 1.0 g of pulverized Ginseng according to Method 4, and perform the test. Prepare the control solution with 1.5 mL of Standard Lead Solution (not more than 15 ppm). Arsenic <1.11>—Prepare the test solution with 1.0 g of pulverized Ginseng according to Method 4, and perform the test (not more than 2 ppm). Foreign matter <5.01>—The amount of stems and other foreign matter contained in Ginseng does not exceed 2.0z. Total BHC's and total DDT's <5.01>—Not more than 0.2 ppm, respectively. Loss on drying <5.01> Not more than 14.0z (6 hours). Total ash <5.01> Not more than 4.2z. Extract content <5.01> Dilute ethanol-soluble extract: not less than 14.0z."
