      "appearance": {
        "en": "Sesame Oil is a clear, pale yellow oil. It is odorless or has a faint, characteristic odor, and has a bland taste. It is miscible with diethyl ether and with petroleum ether. It is slightly soluble in ethanol (95). It congeals between 09C and －59C. Congealing point of the fatty acids: 20 – 259C"
