      "definition": {
        "en": "Alendronate Sodium Tablets contain not less than 95.0z and not more than 105.0z of the labeled amount of alendronic acid (C4H13NO7P2: 249.10). 85z. Start the test with 1 tablet of Alendronate Sodium Tablets, withdraw not less than 10 mL of the medium at the specified minute after starting the test, and centrifuge. Pipet V mL of the supernatant liquid, add water to make exactly V? mL so that each mL contains about 6 mg of alendronic acid (C4H13NO7P2), and use this solution as the sample stock so-lution."
