        "en": "Benzalkonium Chloride Concentrated Solution 50",
        "ja": "濃ベンザルコニウム塩化物液 50"
      },
      "monographId": "JP18-benzalkonium-chloride-concentrated-solution-50",
      "publisher": "JP",
