 of ethyl acetate and acetic acid (100) (10:1) to a distance of about 10 cm, and air-dry the plate. Examine under ultravio- let light (main wavelength: 254 nm): the Rf value of the spot having a smaller Rf value among the spots obtained from the sample solution is the same with that of the spot from the standard solution."
