            "en": "Powder Carvedilol Tablets. To a portion of the powder, equivalent to 20 mg of Carvedilol, add 10 mL of methanol, shake well, and filter. To 0.5 mL of the filtrate add methanol to make 200 mL, and determine the absorp-tion spectrum of this solution as directed under Ultraviolet-visible Spectrophotometry <2.24>: it exhibits maxima be-tween 222 nm and 226 nm, between 241 nm and 245 nm, be- tween 284 nm and 288 nm, between 317 nm and 321 nm and between 330 nm and 334 nm."
          }
