      "definition": {
        "en": "D-Mannitol Injection is an aqueous injection. It contains not less than 95."
      },
      "appearance": {
        "en": "D-Mannitol Injection is a clear, colorless liq-uid. It has a sweet taste. It may precipitate crystals."
