            "en": "To an amount of Docetaxel for Injection, tion of the peak area of docetaxel is not more than 2.0z. equivalent to 20 mg of docetaxel (C 43H 53NO14 ), add 50 mL Bacterial endotoxins <4.01> Less than 2.5 EU/mg. Extractable volume <6.05> It meets the requirement. Foreign insoluble matter <6.06> Perform the test according to Method 1: it meets the requirement. Insoluble particulate matter <6.07> It meets the require-ment. Sterility <4.06> Perform the test according to the Mem-brane filtration method: it meets the requirement."
