oxacin and the internal standard are eluted in this order with the resolution between these peaks being not less than 10. System repeatability: When the test is repeated 6 times with 20 mL of the standard solution under the above operat-ing conditions, the relative standard deviation of the ratio of the peak area of gati‰oxacin to that of the internal standard is not more than 1.0z."
