      "@type": "FormulationMonograph",
      "prefLabel": {
        "en": "Isophane Insulin Human (Genetical Recombination) Injectable Aqueous Suspension",
        "ja": "イソフェンインスリン ヒト(遺伝子組換え)水性懸濁注射液"
