than 80z. Conduct this procedure without exposure to light, using light-resistant vessels. Start the test with 1 tablet of Mecobalamin Tablets, withdraw not less than 20 mL of the medium at the specified minute after starting the test, and filter through a membrane filter with a pore size not exceeding 0.8 mm. Discard not less than 10 mL of the first filtrate, pipet V mL of the subsequent filtrate, and add water to make exactly V? mL so that each mL contains about 0."
