o disintegrate, shake thor-oughly, add water to make exactly 100 mL, and ˆlter through a membrane ˆlter with a pore size not exceeding 0.45 mm. Discard the ˆrst 10 mL of the ˆltrate, pipet V mL of the subsequent ˆltrate, add water to make exactly V? mL so that each mL contains about 20 mg (potency) of minocy-cline (C23H27N3O7), and use this solution as the sample solution."
