            "en": "Proceed as directed in the Identification under Piperacillin Sodium. pH <2.54> The pH of a solution prepared by dissolving an amount of Piperacillin Sodium for Injection, equivalent to 1.0 g (potency) of Piperacillin Sodium, in 4 mL of water is 5.0 – 7.0."
