            "en": "Shake vigorously a quantity of powdered Propiverine Hydrochloride Tablets, equivalent to 50 mg of Propiverine Hydrochloride, with 20 mL of water. Add acetonitrile to make 100 mL, centrifuge, and filter the super-natant liquid, if necessary. Determine the absorption spec-trum of the supernatant liquid or the filtrate under Ultravio-let-visible Spectrophotometry <2.24>: it exhibits a maximum between 257 nm and 261 nm."
          }
