f hydrochlorothiazide are not less than 1000 and not more than 2.0, respectively. System repeatability: When the test is repeated 6 times with 25 mL of the standard solution under the above operat-ing conditions, the relative standard deviation of the peak area of hydrochlorothiazide is not more than 2.0z."
