      "definition": {
        "en": "Hydrocortisone Sodium Phosphate contains not less than 96."
      },
      "appearance": {
        "en": "Hydrocortisone Sodium Phosphate occurs as a white to light yellow powder. It is freely soluble in water, sparingly soluble in methanol, and very slightly soluble in ethanol (95). It is hygroscopic. It shows crystal polymorphism."
