ving elu-tion of tocopherol succinate and tocopherol in this order with the resolution between these peaks being not less than 2.0. System repeatability: Repeat the test 5 times with 20 mL of the standard solution under the above operating conditions: the relative standard deviation of the peak height of tocopherol succinate is not more than 0.8z."
